EXTERNAL Name(charname)

{Name("Winston")}
Wow, good drink, I guess that’s why they call this liquid courage.

{Name("Rana")}
I’m so glad you like it, am I safe from being cadaverified now?

{Name("Winston")}
…

{Name("Rana")}
Hey. I think your next line is-

{Name("Winston")}
I can’t do this anymore.

{Name("Rana")}
What?

{Name("Winston")}
Maybe the west wasn’t beautiful because it lasted.

{Name("Rana")}
Wait, what's going on.

{Name("Winston")}
I’m done trying to play this part. It’s time to move on!

{Name("Rana")}
…

{Name("Rana")}
But.

{Name("Winston")}
Thank you for bestowing your wisdom upon me, wise gnome! I now take my leave.